uniform statement:

> **`CONJ[APPII-UNIFORM]`.** Let `(P,Q)` be a descended pair as in
> PROP 5.5(k), and let `h` be the approximate root of `P` of degree
> `d_2' = gcd(n',m')`, so that `P = h^{m*} + Σ_{i≥2} β_i h^{m*−i}` and
