codex
The first structural hypothesis is now decisively falsified at t=2: the gauge is \(\alpha_t=\alpha_2=0\), so `a2_0` is not even a chart variable. Exact normalization gives
\(H_2=(5y-1)(5y-2)\); both rational fibers have nonzero \(c\), and 12 verified affine eliminations leave four equations in `(b3,b4)` from bands 0–3. Both exact residual bases are `[1]`. The t=1 chart also fits the same grading/quadratic normalizer, but its affine pass reaches a coefficient-field unit after four pivots.
