+S_i=<1>                         1<=i<=t,
+S_i=<1,A>                       t<i<=2t,
+S_i=<1,A,B>                    2t<i<=3t,
+S_e=<1,gamma,A,B,z>             e=3t+1.
+```
+
+The charts are
+
+```text
+P=h^e + sum_(i=1)^e alpha_i h^(e-i), alpha_i in S_i,
+Q=h^q + sum_(j=2)^q beta_j h^(q-j),  beta_j in S_j.
