+| 4 | 65 / 45 | 16; 48 / 29 | `486y^2-270y+35`; 4860 | 38 / 26 | 22 | 8 rows / 4 vars |
+
+### 3.1 `t=1`: `(16,12;13;3)`
+
+Here `x=q2_1`, `y=q3_1`, and
+
+```text
+H_1=54y^2-36y+5,
+c=-4y(9y-1)/81.
+```
+
+After four checked affine pivots the normalized system contains the
