   199	```text
   200	Hhat_t(x,y)=12q^2*y^2-12q(t+1)*x^2*y
   201	             +(t+1)(3t+2)*x^4 = 0,                 (H)
   202	
   203	c=t(3t+1)/(6(2t+1)^3) * x*y
   204	  *((t+1)x^2-6(2t+1)y).                            (C)
