+- `t=1`: **PROVED-HERE**, exact normalized unit and full-chart `[1]`.
+- `t=2`: **PROVED-HERE**, both exact split fibers and full-chart `[1]`.
+- `t=3`: **PROVED-HERE**, exact six-generator quadratic-field `[1]` replay.
