+```text
+486*((15+sqrt15)/54)^2-270*((15+sqrt15)/54)+35
+  =(sqrt15^2-15)/6,
+```
+
+the maps `y -> (15+sqrt15)/54` and `sqrt15 -> 54y-15` identify
