+## 1. Uniform positive grading
+
+**PROVED-HERE.** Assign intrinsic weights
+
+```text
+wt(gamma)=wt(pi)=wt(z)=1, wt(B)=2, wt(A)=3, wt(h)=4,
+wt(b_i)=i.
+```
+
+If a chart coordinate multiplying `phi` in `alpha_i` or `beta_i` is denoted
