+
+### 3.3 `t=3`: `(40,28;37;3)`
+
+Here `x=q4_1`, `y=q7_1`, and
+
+```text
+H_3=147y^2-84y+11,
+c=10y(2-21y)/343.
+```
+
+The fresh replay starts from the frozen charged drivers, repeats the thirteen
+Q pivots, removes six exact Q-associate duplicates and the `H_3` row, and
