+`box/k16uniform-20260903/`. The supporting audits are
+`t2_t1_audit.md`, `t3_normalization_audit.json`,
+`t4_normalization_audit.json`, `t4_affine_audit.json`, and
+`uniform_pattern_audit.md`.

