+### 3.4 `t=4`: `(52,36;49;3)`
+
+Here `x=q5_1`, `y=q9_1`, and
+
+```text
+H_4=486y^2-270y+35,
+c=y(130-1404y)/2187.
+```
+
+Sixteen exact Q-pivots reduce the 65-row/45-unknown chart to 48 rows in 29
