+| `t` | `wt(x)` | `wt(y)` | `wt(c)` |
+|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| 1 | 5 | 10 | 25 |
+| 2 | 9 | 18 | 45 |
+| 3 | 13 | 26 | 65 |
+| 4 | 17 | 34 | 85 |
